menu "Quad Encoder GPIO"
	menuconfig DRIVERS_QUAD_ENCODER_GPIO
		bool "GPIO-based Quadrature Encoder Driver"
		default n
		depends on BOARD_HAS_QENCODER_GPIO
		---help---
			Enable support for GPIO interrupt-based quadrature encoder driver.

			This driver uses GPIO interrupts to decode quadrature encoder signals
			without relying on NuttX timer drivers. It provides direct hardware
			access for STM32H7 and avoids syslog issues.

			The driver supports multiple encoder instances and can be configured
			per board using board-specific configuration files.
